@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Data-driven interprocedural taint and null-flow analysis

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #495057
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "CodePropertyGraph\ntyped AST · DFG · calls · types" as CPG #DBE4FF
component "callee-path reconstruction\nIdentifier / MemberAccess only" as PATH #E9ECEF
component "TaintCatalog\nsource · sink · sanitizer\nexternal model" as CATALOG #FFE8CC
component "local exploded facts\nParam(i) · Ambient(class)\nMaybeNull(origin)" as FACTS #FFF3BF
component "typed transfer\nAST value composition · DFG" as TRANSFER #D3F9D8
component "call-SCC summary solver\ncallee-first · bounded Kleene" as IFDS #C3FAE8
component "summary edges\nparameter→sink · parameter→return\nsource→return" as SUMMARY #E5DBFF
component "canonical predecessor map\nshortest stable NodeId witness" as WITNESS #FCC2D7
component "advisory findings\nclass · CWE · confidence · cap" as OUTPUT #FFE3E3
component "completeness evidence\ncap events · issues · iterations" as COMPLETE #F1F3F5

CPG --> PATH : typed child traversal
PATH --> CATALOG : reconstructed path
CPG --> FACTS : parameters / nulls / DFG
CATALOG --> FACTS : source seeds / sanitizer kills
FACTS --> TRANSFER
TRANSFER --> IFDS : local candidate summary
CPG --> IFDS : validated call SCCs
IFDS --> SUMMARY : <latex>S_f^{(k+1)} = S_f^{(k)} \sqcup F_f(S^{(k)})</latex>
SUMMARY --> IFDS : current callee facts
TRANSFER --> WITNESS : predecessor relaxation
SUMMARY --> WITNESS : interprocedural composition
CATALOG --> OUTPUT : sink class and CWE
WITNESS --> OUTPUT
IFDS --> COMPLETE
COMPLETE --> OUTPUT : capped flag

note bottom of PATH
  This is not a source parser.
  The first typed callee subtree is traversed with a depth and cycle guard.
end note

note bottom of OUTPUT
  The source CPG is read-only.
  A candidate flow is evidence for review, never a vulnerability verdict.
  Negative claims require is_complete().
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| represented CPG evidence |
|<#E9ECEF>| typed callee-path reconstruction |
|<#FFE8CC>| caller-supplied policy catalog |
|<#FFF3BF>| finite IFDS facts |
|<#D3F9D8>| intraprocedural transfer |
|<#C3FAE8>| call graph and fixed-point schedule |
|<#E5DBFF>| procedure summary edges |
|<#FCC2D7>| canonical witness evidence |
|<#FFE3E3>| advisory security finding |
|<#F1F3F5>| completeness and bounds |
endlegend
@enduml
